<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DMG cuts Woolworth.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DMG cuts Woolworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Woolworth Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Thursday, Woolworth posted second operating earnings of $0.19 a share, which matched operating earnings of $0.19 a share a year ago. Woolworth also said its June and July sales were softer than expected, particularly for the athletic group of stores.</p>
<p>-- Woolworth lost 1-3/16 to 25-15/16.</p>
</text>
